  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>It is Haloform reaction.&nbsp;The haloform reaction is the reaction of a methyl ketone with chlorine, bromine, or iodine in the presence of hydroxide ions to give a carboxylate ion and a haloform.&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0090_6f8ba4621f67.png\" style=\"width: 650px; height: 157px;\" /></p>"
